# Worksheet

**F1 – Core loop**: `gameState` single object; `mulberry32(seed)` used for all randomness (map, colonists, events, endTurn trigger — no raw `Math.random()` found); `endTurn()` calls produce→consume→updateColonists→checkStorm→checkTrade→fireEvent in fixed order. Score 2.

**F2 – Map**: 8x8 loop in `generateMap()`, terrain from `gameState.rng()`; `placeBuilding()` checks `b.terrain.includes(tile.terrain)`. No adjacency-bonus code found anywhere. Score 1.

**F3 – Economy**: only single-step transforms (`water→food` in greenhouse); `forge` consumes metal+power but produces nothing; no ash resource ever consumed despite design-note claim. Caps/overflow handled via `clamp()`. Score 1.

**F4 – Population**: colonist records w/ `skills`, `morale`, `fatigue`, `job`, `assigned`; `c.skills[c.job]`/`c.morale`/`c.fatigue` read in `produce()` moraleMult/fatigueMult. Score 2.

**F5 – Needs**: `consume()` computes food/water need, shortfall drops morale −5, `produce()` reads morale via `moraleMult`; morale recovers +1/turn in `updateColonists()` when unassigned. Score 2.

**F6 – Research**: 8 nodes in `RESEARCH_NODES`, prereqs enforced in `doResearch`, costs deducted; `research[x].done` never read by `produce()`/`checkStorm()` — no effect applied anywhere, only counted for score. Score 1.

**F7 – Events**: 11 entries in `EVENTS`, weighted selection loop in `fireEvent()`; 5 events (moraleCrisis, refugees, meteorite, ruins, foodBlight) have 2 choices with distinct state effects; `eventCooldowns[id]=turn+12` checked on refire. Score 2.

**F8 – Trade**: `caravanPrice` is a static constant, never derived from stockpiles or drift; no inventory cap on repeat buy/sell clicks; both `tradeAction` buy/sell branches work. Score 1.

**F9 – Hazard**: `checkStorm()` fires periodically, `weatherSeverity+=0.15` grows dmg; but no building damage flag, no repair function, `stormShield` research never referenced in `checkStorm()`. Score 1.

**F10 – Save/load**: `JSON.stringify(gameState)` shown in textarea; `loadSave()` does `JSON.parse` + `Object.assign`, wrapped in try/catch showing `alert('Error: '+e.message)` — only catches parse syntax errors, no structural validation. Score 1.

**F11 – End conditions**: lose check `colonists.length===0`; win check turn≥60 & pop/food/water thresholds; `calcScore()` combines turn/pop/research/scrip; `gameOver()` renders summary modal. Score 2.

**F12 – UI**: `switchTab`/`renderTab` work; log entries show `T${e.turn}`; keyboard `Space`/`1-6` wired via `keydown` listener; media queries adapt layout; only tile `title` tooltip exists, no numeric-breakdown tooltips. Score 1.

**F13 – Dev panel**: `runTests()` asserts real invariants (caps, prereqs, morale/fatigue ranges, RNG determinism, save/load roundtrip); `runBench()` runs 200 headless `endTurn()` calls and prints `hashState()`. Score 2.

**G1**: `research[x].done` set in `doResearch` but never read in `produce()`/any yield formula — chain absent. Score 0.

**G2**: `consume()` shortfall → `c.morale -= 5` → `produce()` reads `c.morale` in `moraleMult` → scales output every turn. Score 4.

**G3**: `checkStorm()` only touches colonist morale + water resource; no building damage state, no repair function — chain breaks at step 2. Score 0.

**G4**: `caravanPrice` object set once in `gameState` init, never reassigned by stockpile/turn logic. Score 0.

**G5**: `moraleCrisis` (Gathering +12 morale vs Give rations −25 food/+22 morale) and `refugees` (Accept: `addColonist()` x2 vs Turn away: `morale -= 8`) both durably mutate `gameState`. Score 4.

